<%# locals: (payee:) %>
<%# Shown once an organizer picks a recipient carried over from the old transfer
    system. Their old payout details didn't come with them, so set expectations
    that the recipient has to onboard before the money moves. %>

<%= render "application/callout", type: "info", title: "You've paid #{payee.display_name} before",
      class: local_assigns[:class] do %>
  HCB needs them to confirm their details in the new system, so their payout information from your
  earlier transfers isn't carried over. They'll be emailed to submit their payout method and tax
  information before this payment is sent.
<% end %>
